{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0GW0", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{Y}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-gerbe-decent}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:669c305d998d264b0868259f615b4e42b6db2818f3b6d2825f052cca2b83ba00", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:83020b9f08b4bb6adc0758ffcc5c750ee0f55eb8116ca6f21980e3de7713f158", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nIf <MATH_0002> is a gerbe over <MATH_0003> and <MATH_0004> is decent,\nthen <MATH_0005> is decent.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:22ce8323d50dd57ad9788fcc9dbffe23d8bf8cca4af9ec714414f979d4dc5374", "unit_id": "tag:0GW5:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0GW0", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-gerbe-bijection-points}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-qc-decent}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a4cb0b2e759813b15f5b30b9ac08e85cd3d6876cc9f029e2a47bdfea1b332ada", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6e1743bcd7469e69f2377cc1b84ec11c6bda4e62d74b387d362d3ff8e468fb6b", "source_text": "Assume <MATH_0001> is a gerbe over <MATH_0002> and <MATH_0003> is decent.\nNote that <MATH_0004> is a universal homeomorphism by\nLemma <REF_0001>.\nThus the lemma follows from Lemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:11eed7cfc67770abf46801fc28392c21aa63130fbd7002457cd1d4c6da560d2a", "unit_id": "tag:0GW5:proof"}
